### publish_file

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl publish_file { workspace_root runtime packages modules path } =\n    inl full_path = path |> file_system.get_full_path\n    inl dir = full_path |> file_system.directory_get_parent |> optionm'.default_value' \"\"\n    publish_code {\n        workspace_root\n        runtime\n        packages\n        modules\n        output_dir = dir </> \"dist\" |> Some\n        name = full_path |> file_system.get_file_name_without_extension\n        code = full_path |> read_file\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl publish_file { workspace_root runtime packages modules path } =
      inl full_path = path |> file_system.get_full_path
      inl dir = full_path |> file_system.directory_get_parent |> optionm'.default_value' ""
      publish_code {
          workspace_root
          runtime
          packages
          modules
          output_dir = dir </> "dist" |> Some
          name = full_path |> file_system.get_file_name_without_extension
          code = full_path |> read_file
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

